ta-pick="place:annex" data-rel="place:annex" tabindex="0" role="button"><title>Annex (on a lead): A cat points the way.</title><rect class="walls" x="24" y="370" width="84" height="56" rx="3"/><path class="roof" d="M24 380h84"/><text class="name" x="66" y="396" text-anchor="middle">Annex</text><text class="state" x="66" y="421" text-anchor="middle"></text><g class="lead-mark" transform="translate(34 380)"><title>A cat points the way.</title><circle r="8"/><text y="4" text-anchor="middle">?</text></g></g><text class="elsewhere" x="24" y="360">Elsewhere</text></svg></div>
